    "title": "Color Wood Screw",
    "description": "Do you have enough intelligence to solve the tricky puzzles of Color Wood Screw game? If you are confident that you can pass all of our unscrew puzzles, don't wait and challenge yourself.\r\nColor Wood Screw is a screw removal, puzzle, and challenge game.\r\n\r\nHow to unscrew, solve nuts and bolts - screw puzzle\r\n- How to play it is simple, you just need to tap on the nut\r\n- Explore beautiful pictures in our game, solve wood nuts and bolts puzzles to discover exciting rewards.\r\n\r\nGame features:\r\n- Rich and interesting levels.\r\n- Screws, nuts, and woods.\r\n- Brain training.\r\n- Ultimate stress relief.\r\n\r\nColor Wood Screw is an attractive puzzle game, with many levels that challenge the player's IQ by solving unscrew puzzles. Feel the exciting ASMR sound when removing screws and the collision of nuts and bolts. Let's see what's interesting in this exciting Color Wood Screw game that most people love.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you have enough intelligence to solve the tricky puzzles of Color Wood Screw game? If you are confident that you can pass all of our unscrew puzzles, don&#39;t wait and challenge yourself.<br>Color Wood Screw is a screw removal, puzzle, and challenge game.<br><br>How to unscrew, solve nuts and bolts - screw puzzle<br>- How to play it is simple, you just need to tap on the nut<br>- Explore beautiful pictures in our game, solve wood nuts and bolts puzzles to discover exciting rewards.<br><br>Game features:<br>- Rich and interesting levels.<br>- Screws, nuts, and woods.<br>- Brain training.<br>- Ultimate stress relief.<br><br>Color Wood Screw is an attractive puzzle game, with many levels that challenge the player&#39;s IQ by solving unscrew puzzles. Feel the exciting ASMR sound when removing screws and the collision of nuts and bolts. Let&#39;s see what&#39;s interesting in this exciting Color Wood Screw game that most people love.",
